# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IP boundary — deliberately NOT published.
#
# ECM-EKF/ holds the Simulink DEKF model, the parameter-identification
# pipeline and identified cell parameters. That pipeline is the actual product
# (models are commodity; commissioning a new cell is not), and some of the
# source data comes from a partner project. This repository is public, so the
# whole folder stays out of it.
#
# It is therefore NOT backed up by this repo. Keep a separate private backup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ECM-EKF/

# Working notes and internal planning. Not documentation, and they reference
# partner-project names and local paths that should not be published.
diary.md
ROADMAP.md

